Example valid quest spec: {"giverNpcId":"tam","steps":[{"type":"TALK_TO","npcId":"mai"},{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"cake","npcId":"mai"}],"scope":"solo","title":"Wedding cake express","description":"My helmet is at the polisher, so I cannot drive this wedding cake myself. Check in with Mai, then carry the cake to her — gently, it is three tiers of trust.","payoff":"Smooth ride? Do not tell me. I will tell everyone it was smooth.","twist":{"step":{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"cake","npcId":"ba"},"line":"Mai: the wedding moved to the riverside! Ông Ba is the chủ hôn now. Take the cake to him."}}",
  "thao": "
