Example valid quest spec: {"giverNpcId":"vy","steps":[{"type":"GO_TO","locationId":"alley"},{"type":"TALK_TO","npcId":"hoa"},{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"postcard","npcId":"thao"}],"scope":"solo","title":"A lantern needs a name","description":"A new lantern needs a name and a dramatic backstory. Hang it in the alley, ask Cô Hoa for the name, then send the announcement postcard to Thao.","payoff":"Alex photographed Pho Moon at dusk? A lantern with its own backstory and a portrait. Immortal.","twist":{"step":{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"postcard","npcId":"alex"},"line":"Hoa: I named it \\"Pho Moon.\\" Thao hates puns, so send the card to Alex — he will photograph it."}}",
